screen.world=世界
option.edgeHighlight=邊緣描邊
option.edgeHighlight.comment=受《Minecraft Dungeons》啟發的邊緣描邊效果
option.edgeHighlightScale=邊緣描邊粗細
option.edgeHighlightScale.comment=控制描邊粗細;依資源包解析度調整
screen.weather=天氣
option.randomWeatherVariation=隨機變化
option.randomWeatherVariation.comment=Adds random per-session changes to the weather, so temperature, humidity and windiness drift on their own instead of staying fixed.
option.biomeWeatherVariation=生物群系變化
option.biomeWeatherVariation.comment=Lets the weather vary from one biome to the next, so a cold biome can be overcast while a hot one stays dry.
option.weatherTemperatureBias=溫度偏差
option.weatherTemperatureBias.comment=Shifts the baseline temperature of the weather. Higher values make the world warmer, lower values make it colder.
option.weatherTemperatureVariationSpeed=溫度變化速率
option.weatherTemperatureVariationSpeed.comment=How quickly the temperature drifts over time. Higher values make the temperature swing faster.
option.weatherHumidityBias=濕度偏差
option.weatherHumidityBias.comment=Shifts the baseline humidity of the weather. Higher values make the air more humid, lower values make it drier.
option.weatherHumidityVariationSpeed=濕度變化速率
option.weatherHumidityVariationSpeed.comment=How quickly the humidity drifts over time. Higher values make the humidity swing faster.
option.weatherWindBias=風速偏差
option.weatherWindBias.comment=Shifts the baseline windiness of the weather. Higher values mean stronger wind and faster drifting clouds.
option.weatherWindVariationSpeed=風速變化速率
option.weatherWindVariationSpeed.comment=How quickly the windiness drifts over time. Higher values make the wind change faster.
option.weatherTurbulenceBias=Turbulence Bias
option.weatherTurbulenceBias.comment=Shifts baseline turbulence. Higher values tear clouds into broken, wispy detail.
option.weatherTurbulenceVariationSpeed=Turbulence Variation Speed
option.weatherTurbulenceVariationSpeed.comment=How fast turbulence drifts. Higher values make cloud detail churn faster.
screen.moonPhaseInfluence=Moon Phase Influence
option.moonPhaseAffectsBrightness=月相影響亮度
option.moonPhaseAffectsBrightness.comment=夜間亮度會根據月相改變
option.moonPhaseInfluenceIntensity=Moon Phase Influence Intensity
option.moonPhaseInfluenceIntensity.comment=Adjusts how strongly the current moon phase affects all moon-phased effects below. 0 = no effect, 1 = full effect.
option.moonPhaseNightAtmosphere=Moon-Phased Night Atmosphere
option.moonPhaseNightAtmosphere.comment=When enabled, fog and sky atmosphere at night vary with the lunar cycle.
option.moonPhaseNightAtmosphereIntensity=Night Atmosphere Intensity
option.moonPhaseNightAtmosphereIntensity.comment=Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects atmospheric fog brightness at night.
option.moonPhaseReflections=Moon-Phased Reflections
option.moonPhaseReflections.comment=When enabled, the brightness and color of reflections vary with the lunar cycle.
option.moonPhaseReflectionsIntensity=Reflections Intensity
option.moonPhaseReflectionsIntensity.comment=Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects reflection brightness at night.
screen.worldVegetation=Vegetation
option.wavingPlants=植物擺動
option.wavingPlants.comment=地面植物會隨風擺動。\n\n要新增擺動植物，請打開 shaders/block.properties，並將方塊加入對應類別(10016、10017 或 10018)
option.wavingLeaves=樹葉擺動
option.wavingLeaves.comment=樹葉方塊會隨風擺動。\n\n要新增擺動樹葉方塊，請打開 shaders/block.properties，並將方塊加入對應類別(10019)
screen.light=光影
option.directionalLightmaps=方向性光照貼圖
option.directionalLightmaps.comment=讓方塊光與天光受法線貼圖影響;可能有些視覺異常
option.directionalLightmapsIntensity=方向性光照貼圖強度
option.directionalLightmapsIntensity.comment=How strongly the lightmap is skewed by the direction the light arrives from. Higher values give surfaces a more directional, less even lighting.
screen.lightSources=光源
option.sunI=Sunlight Intensity
option.sunI.comment=Adjusts the overall brightness of direct sunlight. Higher = brighter sun, stronger highlights and shadows.
option.moonI=Moonlight Intensity
option.moonI.comment=Adjusts the overall brightness of moonlight. Higher = brighter nights, more visible shadows at night.
option.blocklightI=Block Light Intensity
option.blocklightI.comment=Adjusts the overall brightness of block light sources. Higher = stronger torch and lamp illumination.
option.caveLightI=Cave Ambient
option.caveLightI.comment=Adjusts the base brightness of underground ambient light when no direct light is present. Higher = caves appear less pitch-black.
option.shadingStrength=陰影對比
option.shadingStrength.comment=調整直射光陰影對比;降低可讓背光面更亮，提高則更暗
option.netherI=Nether Fog Intensity
option.netherI.comment=Adjusts the overall brightness of Nether fog and ambient light. Higher = brighter, more washed-out Nether.
option.endLightI=End Direct Intensity
option.endLightI.comment=Adjusts the brightness of direct light in the End. Higher = stronger highlights from the End light source.
screen.sunlightColor=陽光色彩
screen.sunlightMorning=早晨
option.sunMr=§c▍ §fRed — Morning
option.sunMr.comment=Adjusts the red tint of sunlight at sunrise. Higher = warmer, redder dawn light.
option.sunMg=§a▍ §fGreen — Morning
option.sunMg.comment=Adjusts the green tint of sunlight at sunrise. Affects the balance between orange and yellow dawn.
option.sunMb=§9▍ §fBlue — Morning
option.sunMb.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of sunlight at sunrise. Higher = less orange, more neutral morning.
screen.sunlightNoon=中午
option.sunNr=§c▍ §fRed — Noon
option.sunNr.comment=Adjusts the red tint of sunlight at noon. Higher = warmer midday sun.
option.sunNg=§a▍ §fGreen — Noon
option.sunNg.comment=Adjusts the green tint of sunlight at noon. Higher = less pink, more neutral daylight.
option.sunNb=§9▍ §fBlue — Noon
option.sunNb.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of sunlight at noon. Higher = cooler, more bluish midday light.
screen.sunlightEvening=傍晚
option.sunEr=§c▍ §fRed — Evening
option.sunEr.comment=Adjusts the red tint of sunlight at sunset. Higher = warmer, redder dusk light.
option.sunEg=§a▍ §fGreen — Evening
option.sunEg.comment=Adjusts the green tint of sunlight at sunset. Affects the balance between orange and yellow dusk.
option.sunEb=§9▍ §fBlue — Evening
option.sunEb.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of sunlight at sunset. Higher = cooler, less orange evening light.
screen.moonlightColor=月光色彩
option.moonR=§c▍ §fRed — Moonlight
option.moonR.comment=Adjusts the red tint of moonlight. Higher = warmer night light.
option.moonG=§a▍ §fGreen — Moonlight
option.moonG.comment=Adjusts the green tint of moonlight. Affects the coolness of night lighting.
option.moonB=§9▍ §fBlue — Moonlight
option.moonB.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of moonlight. Higher = cooler, more bluish nights.
screen.blocklightColor=方塊光色彩
option.blocklightR=§c▍ §fRed — Block Light
option.blocklightR.comment=Adjusts the red tint of artificial block lights (torches, lanterns, glowstone). Higher = warmer block light.
option.blocklightG=§a▍ §fGreen — Block Light
option.blocklightG.comment=Adjusts the green tint of block lights. Affects the orange-to-yellow balance of torch light.
option.blocklightB=§9▍ §fBlue — Block Light
option.blocklightB.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of block lights. Higher = cooler, whiter light.
screen.lightNether=地獄
option.netherUseBiomeColor=Use Biome Color
option.netherUseBiomeColor.comment=When enabled, Nether fog and ambient color adapts to the current biome. When disabled, uses the static color below.
option.netherI=Nether Fog Intensity
option.netherI.comment=Adjusts the overall brightness of Nether fog and ambient light. Higher = brighter, more washed-out Nether.
option.netherS=Nether Fog Saturation
option.netherS.comment=Adjusts the color vividness of Nether fog. Higher = more saturated orange/red, lower = more grey.
screen.netherColor=基礎色彩
option.netherR=§c▍ §fRed — Nether
option.netherR.comment=Adjusts the red tint of the static Nether ambient color (when Use Biome Color is off).
option.netherG=§a▍ §fGreen — Nether
option.netherG.comment=Adjusts the green tint of the static Nether ambient color. Affects the orange-to-yellow balance.
option.netherB=§9▍ §fBlue — Nether
option.netherB.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of the static Nether ambient color. Higher = more purple/cooler Nether.
screen.lightEnd=終界
option.endLightI=End Direct Intensity
option.endLightI.comment=Adjusts the brightness of direct light in the End. Higher = stronger highlights from the End light source.
option.endAmbientI=End Ambient Intensity
option.endAmbientI.comment=Adjusts the brightness of ambient skylight in the End. Higher = less contrast, more evenly lit.
screen.endLightColor=光線色彩
option.endLightR=§c▍ §fRed — End Light
option.endLightR.comment=Adjusts the red tint of direct light in the End (from the central light source).
option.endLightG=§a▍ §fGreen — End Light
option.endLightG.comment=Adjusts the green tint of direct light in the End.
option.endLightB=§9▍ §fBlue — End Light
option.endLightB.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of direct light in the End. Higher = cooler, more bluish End light.
screen.endAmbientColor=環境色彩
option.endAmbientR=§c▍ §fRed — End Ambient
option.endAmbientR.comment=Adjusts the red tint of ambient skylight in the End.
option.endAmbientG=§a▍ §fGreen — End Ambient
option.endAmbientG.comment=Adjusts the green tint of ambient skylight in the End.
option.endAmbientB=§9▍ §fBlue — End Ambient
option.endAmbientB.comment=Adjusts the blue tint of ambient skylight in the End. Higher = more violet/blue ambient.
screen.directLight=Direct Light
screen.shadowsGeneral=General
option.shadow=Shadows
option.shadow.comment=Enables shadows cast by the sun and moon onto the world. Disable for maximum performance — no shadows will be rendered.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Adjusts the size of the shadow map texture. Higher = sharper, more detailed shadows at higher VRAM and GPU cost.
suffix.shadowMapResolution=²
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=Maximum distance shadows are rendered, in blocks. Higher values show shadows farther away but reduce detail per block and increase cost.
value.shadowDistance.48.0=3 區塊
value.shadowDistance.64.0=4 區塊
value.shadowDistance.80.0=5 區塊
value.shadowDistance.96.0=6 區塊
value.shadowDistance.112.0=7 區塊
value.shadowDistance.128.0=8 區塊
value.shadowDistance.144.0=9 區塊
value.shadowDistance.160.0=10 區塊
value.shadowDistance.176.0=11 區塊
value.shadowDistance.192.0=12 區塊
value.shadowDistance.208.0=13 區塊
value.shadowDistance.224.0=14 區塊
value.shadowDistance.240.0=15 區塊
value.shadowDistance.256.0=16 區塊
value.shadowDistance.320.0=20 區塊
value.shadowDistance.384.0=24 區塊
value.shadowDistance.512.0=32 區塊
value.shadowDistance.768.0=48 區塊
value.shadowDistance.1024.0=64 區塊
value.shadowDistance.2048.0=128 區塊
value.shadowDistance.4096.0=256 區塊
screen.shadowsQuality=Shadow Quality
option.shadowSsrt=Distant Shadows
option.shadowSsrt.comment=Extends shadows beyond the shadow map distance using screen-space ray tracing. Fills in far shadows without increasing shadow map size. Moderate performance cost.
option.shadowSsrtSteps=Distant Shadow Quality
option.shadowSsrtSteps.comment=Adjusts the number of ray steps for screen-space distant shadows. Higher = more accurate, less noisy far shadows at higher GPU cost.
option.shadowVps=可變半影
option.shadowVps.comment=距離越遠陰影越柔和
option.shadowVpsQuality=VPS Quality
option.shadowVpsQuality.comment=Controls the blocker-search sample count for Variable Penumbra Shadows. Higher values improve penumbra stability at additional GPU cost.
option.shadowPcf=Shadowmap Filtering
option.shadowPcf.comment=Softens shadow edges using percentage-closer filtering. When enabled, shadows look smoother and less pixelated.
option.shadowPcfStepsScale=Filter Quality
option.shadowPcfStepsScale.comment=Scales how many filter taps the shadowmap filtering uses. Higher = smoother, less noisy soft shadows at higher GPU cost.
screen.shadowsCoverage=Shadow Coverage
option.entityShadows=Entity Shadows
option.entityShadows.comment=When enabled, living entities and dropped items cast shadows.\nDisable to improve performance in survival bases with large farms.
option.blockEntityShadows=Block Entity Shadows
option.blockEntityShadows.comment=When enabled, chests, signs, banners and other block entities cast shadows. Lower cost than full entity shadows.
option.cloudShadows=雲層陰影
option.cloudShadows.comment=雲朵在地面投下的陰影
option.cloudShadowsIntensity=雲層陰影強度
option.cloudShadowsIntensity.comment=How dark the shadows that clouds cast on the ground are. Higher values give deeper, better defined shadows under the clouds.
screen.shadowsStyle=Shadow Style
option.pixelatedShadows=Pixelated Shadows
option.pixelatedShadows.comment=Shadows snap to the block texel grid, creating a retro pixelated look. For stylistic screenshots.
option.pixelatedShadowsRes=Pixel Size
option.pixelatedShadowsRes.comment=Adjusts the texel grid size for pixelated shadows. Lower = chunkier, more blocky pixels.
option.shadowColor=有色陰影
option.shadowColor.comment=Lets light that passes through translucent blocks tint the shadow they cast, so stained glass and coloured blocks colour their shadows.
option.shadowColorIntensity=Tint Strength
option.shadowColorIntensity.comment=Adjusts how strongly translucent blocks tint the shadows behind them. Higher = deeper, more saturated color bleed; 0 = plain white shadows.
screen.indirectLight=Indirect Light
option.indirectResReduction=Indirect Lighting Res.
option.indirectResReduction.comment=Resolution of the SSPT trace and filter buffers, relative to the screen. Lower = faster but softer indirect light.
value.indirectResReduction.1=100%
value.indirectResReduction.2=50%
value.indirectResReduction.3=33%
value.indirectResReduction.4=25%
option.ssptEnabled=SSPT
option.ssptEnabled.comment=Screen-space path traced emission and colored lighting. Big performance impact.
option.ssptFullRangeRT=Long Range SSPT
option.ssptFullRangeRT.comment=Traces the whole screen instead of a short range. Needs more samples for similar quality.
option.ssptSPP=Samples per Pixel
option.ssptSPP.comment=Paths traced per pixel per frame. More samples = less noise, more cost.
option.ssptBounces=Bounces
option.ssptBounces.comment=Path bounces per sample. More bounces = more colored light bleed.
option.ssptLightmapBlend=Lightmap Blending
option.ssptLightmapBlend.comment=How strongly the vanilla lightmap blocklight blends into the SSPT accumulation.
option.ssptEmissionDistance=Emission Distance
option.ssptEmissionDistance.comment=How far colored emission carries before fading out (blocks).
option.ssptEmissionMode=Emission Mode
option.ssptEmissionMode.comment=Emission source used by SSPT. Only affects SSPT.
value.ssptEmissionMode.0=Hardcoded
value.ssptEmissionMode.1=Hardcoded + LabPBR
value.ssptEmissionMode.2=LabPBR Only
option.ssptIntensity=Emission Intensity
option.ssptIntensity.comment=Global brightness multiplier for the emission contribution of the indirect lighting pass.
option.indirectLightingIntensity=Indirect Lighting Intensity
option.indirectLightingIntensity.comment=Brightness multiplier for indirect lighting: skylight and the sun/moon bounce. Emission is not affected.
option.shaderAo=Shader AO
option.shaderAo.comment=AO 演算法。Off-關閉, SSAO-品質低但計算量少, GTAO-品質佳但計算量大
value.shaderAo.shaderAoNone=關閉
value.shaderAo.shaderAoSsao=SSAO
value.shaderAo.shaderAoGtao=GTAO
option.vanillaAo=原版 AO
option.vanillaAo.comment=遊戲內建遮蔽
screen.ssptFilter=SVGF Filter
option.svgfFilter=Filtering
option.svgfFilter.comment=SVGF a-trous filter: removes the remaining SSPT noise edge-aware.
option.maxFrames=Max Accumulated Frames
option.maxFrames.comment=Temporal history length. Higher = smoother, but more ghosting.
option.svgfRad=Filter Radius
option.svgfRad.comment=Tap radius of each a-trous filter iteration.
option.svgfStrictness=Luminance Strictness
option.svgfStrictness.comment=How aggressively the filter preserves brightness differences.
option.svgfNormalexp=Normal Weight
option.svgfNormalexp.comment=How strongly surface normal differences block filtering across edges.
screen.ambientLight=Ambient Light
option.hBasisSkylight=H-Basis Skylight
option.hBasisSkylight.comment=Directional sky ambient from a live H-basis projection of the sky map. Off falls back to the flat sky average.
option.hBasisIntensity=Ambient Intensity
option.hBasisIntensity.comment=Master brightness of directional sky ambient. Higher = brighter sky fill.
option.hBasisSkySamples=Projection Samples
option.hBasisSkySamples.comment=Sky directions sampled per frame for the H-basis projection. Higher = smoother, more accurate ambient at higher cost.
screen.atmosphere=Atmosphere
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Path Tilt
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilts the sun and moon path across the sky in degrees. Negative values tilt south. Affects time-of-day lighting direction.
suffix.sunPathRotation=°
option.vl=體積霧
option.vl.comment=新增光柱與可變霧密度
option.overworldFogIntensity=主世界霧強度
option.overworldFogIntensity.comment=Overall strength of the overworld air fog. Higher values thicken the haze and reduce how far you can see.
screen.atmoSpace=Space
screen.stars=星星
option.stars=啟用星空
option.stars.comment=夜空中的星星，效能影響低
option.starsIntensity=星光強度
option.starsIntensity.comment=Brightness of the stars in the night sky. Higher values make the stars brighter and easier to pick out, lower values dim them into the background.
option.starsCoverage=星星覆蓋度
option.starsCoverage.comment=How many stars are drawn in the night sky. Higher values give a denser star field, lower values leave the sky emptier. The stars still fade out in daylight and behind clouds.
screen.spaceGalaxy=Galaxy
option.galaxy=銀河
option.galaxy.comment=Draws a galaxy image in the night sky. It rotates with the sun and moon and is dimmed by daylight and clouds.
option.galaxyIntensity=銀河亮度
option.galaxyIntensity.comment=Brightness of the galaxy image in the night sky. Higher values make the galaxy more visible, lower values fade it into the background.
screen.planet=Planet
option.planetBounce=Planet Bounce Light
option.planetBounce.comment=Ground-bounced sun and moonlight re-scattered through the air. Warms the horizon and downward views almost for free.
option.planetBounceIntensity=Planet Bounce Intensity
option.planetBounceIntensity.comment=Adjusts the strength of ground-bounced light re-entering the sky. Higher = brighter, warmer horizon glow; 0 disables the contribution entirely.
option.renderBelowHorizon=Render Below Horizon
option.renderBelowHorizon.comment=Renders the planet ground disc for below-horizon rays instead of stretching the horizon sky downward.
option.renderBelowHorizonIntensity=Below Horizon Brightness
option.renderBelowHorizonIntensity.comment=Brightness of the planet ground rendered below the horizon.
screen.aurora=極光
option.auroraNormal=任何生物群系極光
option.auroraNormal.comment=Selects the aurora in any biome mode or method.
value.auroraNormal.auroraNever=從不
value.auroraNormal.auroraRarely=偶爾
value.auroraNormal.auroraAlways=總是
option.auroraSnow=雪地生物群系極光
option.auroraSnow.comment=Selects the aurora in snow biome mode or method.
value.auroraSnow.auroraNever=從不
value.auroraSnow.auroraRarely=偶爾
value.auroraSnow.auroraAlways=總是
option.auroraBrightness=極光亮度
option.auroraBrightness.comment=How bright the aurora is in the night sky. Higher values give more vivid curtains and also light the ground more.
option.auroraFrequency=極光頻率
option.auroraFrequency.comment=How often the aurora appears in the night sky. Higher values make it appear less often.
option.auroraCloudLight=雲層光貢獻
option.auroraCloudLight.comment=Lets the aurora light up the clouds. When enabled the clouds are tinted by the aurora instead of staying dark.
option.auroraGroundLight=地面光照貢獻
option.auroraGroundLight.comment=控制極光向地面光照的貢獻量。數值越高，地形、水面等受天空照明的表面會被極光顏色照亮得越明顯。
screen.rainbows=Rainbows
option.rainbows=Rainbows
option.rainbows.comment=When enabled, a faint rainbow appears opposite the sun during and just after rain.
option.rainbowsIntensity=Rainbow Visibility
option.rainbowsIntensity.comment=Adjusts the opacity and vividness of rainbows during/after rain. Higher = brighter, more saturated rainbow.
screen.atmoSky=Sky
option.cloudsTemporalUpscaling=時域升頻
option.cloudsTemporalUpscaling.comment=How many frames the cloud buffer is averaged over. Higher values give smoother, more stable clouds but smear the motion of fast moving clouds.
value.cloudsTemporalUpscaling.1=關閉
value.cloudsTemporalUpscaling.2=4×
value.cloudsTemporalUpscaling.3=9×
value.cloudsTemporalUpscaling.4=16×
option.cloudsScale=縮放比例
option.cloudsScale.comment=套用於所有雲層的縮放因子;1.0 為預設(第一層約 800 格高)，數值越大則雲越小、距離越近，並影響雲影大小
suffix.cloudsScale=×
option.cloudsAerialPerspectiveBoost=空氣透視強化
option.cloudsAerialPerspectiveBoost.comment=Extends how far the atmosphere's aerial perspective is applied to cloud rays, so distant clouds blend into the horizon haze sooner.
option.cloudsCumulus=積雲
option.cloudsCumulus.comment=低空體素化積雲
option.cloudsAltocumulus=高積雲
option.cloudsAltocumulus.comment=中空體素化高積雲
option.cloudsCumulusCongestus=暴積雲
option.cloudsCumulusCongestus.comment=巨量且遙遠的體素雲朵
option.cloudsCirrus=卷雲與高積雲
option.cloudsCirrus.comment=Planar high-altitude cirrus and cirrocumulus clouds. They are flat layers drawn overhead rather than volumetric clouds.
option.cloudsNoctilucent=夜光雲
option.cloudsNoctilucent.comment=High-altitude clouds that catch the sunlight after sunset and glow in the night sky. They only become visible once it is dark.
option.blockyClouds=方塊雲
option.blockyClouds.comment=原版風格的體素雲;啟用後會停用其他雲型
screen.cloudsCumulus=積雲設定
option.cloudsCumulusPrecomputeLocalCoverage=預先計算區域覆蓋
option.cloudsCumulusPrecomputeLocalCoverage.comment=激進優化積雲覆蓋範圍;截圖時請先關閉
option.cloudsCumulusPrimaryStepsH=地平線光線步數
option.cloudsCumulusPrimaryStepsH.comment=Number of ray-march samples used to find the cumulus clouds when looking towards the horizon. More steps resolve thin cloud detail but cost more GPU time.
option.cloudsCumulusPrimaryStepsZ=天頂光線步數
option.cloudsCumulusPrimaryStepsZ.comment=Number of ray-march samples used to find the cumulus clouds when looking straight up. More steps resolve thin cloud detail but cost more GPU time.
option.cloudsCumulusLightSteps=照明取樣步數
option.cloudsCumulusLightSteps.comment=Number of extra samples used to march towards the sun for cloud lighting. More steps give softer, more accurate light gradients inside the cloud.
option.cloudsCumulusAmbientSteps=環境取樣步數
option.cloudsCumulusAmbientSteps.comment=Number of extra samples used to gather ambient sky light inside the clouds. More steps reduce the noise in dark cloud interiors.
option.cloudsCumulusAltitude=海拔高度
option.cloudsCumulusAltitude.comment=Height of the bottom of the cumulus layer above sea level, in blocks. Raising it lifts the whole layer.
suffix.cloudsCumulusAltitude=公尺
suffix.cloudsCumulusAltitude=公尺/秒
suffix.cloudsCumulusAltitude=度
option.cloudsCumulusThickness=厚度
option.cloudsCumulusThickness.comment=Vertical thickness of the cumulus layer in blocks. Thicker layers stack more cloud on top of each other and cast deeper shadows.
option.cloudsCumulusDensity=密度
option.cloudsCumulusDensity.comment=How much cloud material sits inside a covered area. Higher values make the clouds look more solid, lower values make them wispier.
option.cloudsCumulusCoverage=覆蓋度
option.cloudsCumulusCoverage.comment=How much of the sky the cumulus layer covers. Higher values give an overcast sky, lower values leave more clear sky.
option.cloudsCumulusSize=大小
option.cloudsCumulusSize.comment=Size of the individual cumulus clumps. Bigger clumps read as a coarser, more stylized cloud shape.
option.cloudsCumulusDetailStrength=細節強度
option.cloudsCumulusDetailStrength.comment=How much fine noise is carved out of the cumulus body. Higher values give puffier, more detailed edges, lower values give smooth blobs.
