option.cloudShadowsIntensity=雲層陰影強度
option.cloudShadowsIntensity.comment=How dark the shadows that clouds cast on the ground are. Higher values give deeper, better defined shadows under the clouds.
option.blockyCloudsWindSpeed=Wind Speed
option.blockyCloudsWindSpeed.comment=How fast the blocky clouds drift across the sky. The direction is set by the blocky cloud wind angle.
suffix.blockyCloudsWindSpeed=m/s
